                    "text": "@RepAdamGrayCA EXTREMELY disappointed in your vote-that is shameful!. You said you would work across the aisle! You voted for a huge tax hike, tax on tips, tax on OT,  against sageguarding the border, against working people, and for a weak military! You serve your party-not your constituents.",
